            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.16+1KI.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 10.16-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.15+2CH.9.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 9.15-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nono Shishaki omwami owa Misiri eecha ebwaakala Yerusalemu. Abukula bibiindu bie mu mabiikhilo ke mu Lukaangu lwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne bie mu mabiikhilo ke munju eyo mwami. Abukula buli siindu acha nasio. Akhaba lundi abukula chingabo che sahabu nicho Solomoni aba ne akhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Omwami Rehoboamu akhola chingabo che kumukasa mu bweyaangu bwe echo mala achielesia banamae bakhulu baliindi babaliinda kumuliango kwe enju eyo mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli lwoosi nga omwami achichanga mu nju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, banamae baliindi bechanga babukula chingabo echo bacha nacho mala bachikobosia mu lusiro lwe buliindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne sikila omwami eboombia, burafu bwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi bwawa, nio khubabunia elala tawe, ne limenya liaba lilayi mu Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khukhwamia khwa Rehoboamu mu bwimbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwami Rehoboamu aandalasia bubwami bwewe mu Yerusalemu mala amiia. Rehoboamu aaba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kane na mulala nga ne arakikha khukhwamiia. Amiia kimiiko ekhumi na saba ne ali mu Yerusalemu. Lukoba olwo lwaba nilwo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi arobora mu kholo che Baisiraeli choosi khuba abuundu e khusaayilao. Lisina lia maawe liaba Nahama Omuamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala akhola bumayaanu, sikila mu mwoyo kwewe se aenja Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bia Rehoboamu khukhwama mu khunyoa khukhwola ematabusia biaandikwa mu sitabu sie chingano cho omung'oosi Shemaya ne Ito owe kamalola. Liabao liie liliachiililila busa akari wa Rehoboamu ne Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu aafwa mala asiikhwa mu Lukoba lwa Daudi. Abicha omusoleeli wewe amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
